: \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Modify dialog changed time 12:30→18:00 and party size 2→4 Guests for Sakura Garden booking; list updated correctly with \\\"Reservation Updated\\\" toast and accurate new values.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clearing the search box does not perform a filtered search or show an error; it simply reverts to displaying the full unfiltered list of 6 restaurants (no explicit empty-search action is possible).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate review not blocked\", \"actual\": \"Submitted an identical review (same name, date of visit, and text) for Trattoria Bella twice in a row; both submissions succeeded (\\\"Review Submitted!\\\" shown each time) and the review count incremented from (1)→(2)→(3) with two duplicate entries, with no restriction or error preventing the repeat submission.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon validity rules not fully enforced\", \"actual\": \"GROUP15 correctly rejected for party size <6 (\\\"This coupon requires a party of 6 or more\\\") and only one coupon can be active at a time (input replaced by applied badge), satisfying the no-combination rule. However, WEEKEND20 (advertised as \\\"20% off weekend dining\\\") was accepted and applied both with no date selected and with a weekday date (Tuesday, Sep 8, 2026) selected — the system does not validate the coupon's weekend-only condition against the chosen reservation date.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"No edit controls exist for restaurant price/hours/info anywhere in the UI (view-only). Party size selector is capped at a maximum of 10 guests, enforcing a per-table capacity limit.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No real-time discounted price calculation shown\", \"actual\": \"After selecting date/time/party size, coupons can be applied and validity is checked (invalid codes rejected, party-size rule enforced) and submitting without required fields is blocked. However, at no point does the app display an actual computed price/total (only price-tier symbols like \\\"$$$$\\\" and a qualitative \\\"-15% off\\\" badge) — there is no real-time discounted dollar amount calculated or shown before or after applying a coupon.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking Modify opens a dialog to re-select time/party size and save; clicking Cancel opens an alertdialog \\\"Cancel Reservation?\\\" requiring explicit \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\" confirmation (or \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" to abort) before the booking is cancelled.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No message/notification center\", \"actual\": \"Pop-up toast notifications do appear in real time for booking confirm/modify/cancel/review/coupon events. However, there is no message center or notification history page anywhere in the app (nav only offers \\\"Restaurants\\\" and \\\"My Reservations\\\"; a DOM scan found no additional routes/links) to view past notifications after they disappear.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Personal center lacks comment history and applications\", \"actual\": \"\\\"My Reservations\\\" (the personal center) only shows Upcoming/Past reservation cards; there is no section listing the user's own submitted reviews/comment history or any distinct \\\"applications\\\" (e.g., coupon usage) list — only booking records are visible.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
